# Scratch space for verification screenshots and other intermediates.
# Nothing in here is ever committed or deployed, and it is safe to delete
# at any time. See CLAUDE.md rule 5 — screenshots go here, then get removed
# once the change they verify has been reported.
.tmp/

# Stray screenshots outside .tmp/, so a misplaced capture cannot reach the
# live site. Real site imagery belongs in assets/.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp

# OS and editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
